{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">樊亦敏與周嘉洛這對深得觀眾喜愛的拍檔，自《愛．回家之開心速遞》結緣後，近日終於在剛煞科的新劇《驅魔速遞》中再度合作，消息一出令大批劇迷大感期待！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"amyfan3796_1791196766_4001165009765676405_6719677233.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KuZWmp0K0A1791270668.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"amyfan3796_1791196766_4001165009765676405_6719677233.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">日前，樊亦敏在社交平台大派「回憶殺」，晒出與嘉洛在2019年、2020年及2026年的溫馨對比合照，見證了兩人跨越七年的深厚情誼與共同蛻變。回顧2019及2020年的照片，兩人對著鏡頭展露燦爛笑容，當時的嘉洛仍帶點青澀；時光飛逝，來到2026年《驅魔速遞》的合體照，嘉洛明顯褪去當年的稚氣，變得更加成熟穩重。相反，樊亦敏卻猶如食了防腐劑般依然保養得宜，明艷照人。兩人在鏡頭前親密搭膊頭、貼臉自拍，足見私下感情依然極度要好。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"amyfan3796_1791196766_4001165011804221470_6719677233.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026otr3MngNjk1791270668.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"amyfan3796_1791196766_4001165011804221470_6719677233.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">能與好拍檔合作多年，樊亦敏亦相當感觸地發文：「三太很開心和金城安一起成長❤️也和您們一起渡過很多人生不同階段❤️今次在《驅魔速遞》中我很開心可以再次同周嘉洛合作，希望大家繼續支持我們❤️️😍」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"amyfan3796_1791196766_4001165012852645909_6719677233.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026UfngBsKH9r1791270668.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"amyfan3796_1791196766_4001165012852645909_6719677233.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"amyfan3796_1791196766_4001165013330824364_6719677233.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wOS0WxmPtS1791270669.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"amyfan3796_1791196766_4001165013330824364_6719677233.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">不過感性過後，三太下一秒突然畫風一轉，搞笑地向嘉洛「逼供」：「不過唔知周嘉洛開唔開心呢🤔🤔🤔🤔大家🉑唔可以幫我問問佢🤣」帖文隨即引出本尊親自現身，嘉洛立刻以一個「心形」及「相擁」的表情符號回覆，互動Sweet到爆。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">大批粉絲紛紛讚好，表示極度期待二人再度合作擦出新火花，更有網民精準留言大讚：「嘉洛愈嚟愈靚仔，你又愈嚟愈後生！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T08:20:09.075885+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":546,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}